# Input

```vue
<template>
  <p>Templates are formatted as well...
    </p>
</template>

<script>
let Prettier        = format => { your.js('though') }
</script>

<style>
.and { css: too !important }
</style>

```


# Prettier differences

```diff
--- Prettier
+++ Biome
@@ -1,15 +1,12 @@
 <template>
-  <p>Templates are formatted as well...</p>
+  <p>Templates are formatted as well...
+    </p>
 </template>
 
 <script>
-let Prettier = (format) => {
-  your.js("though");
-};
+let Prettier        = format => { your.js('though') }
 </script>
 
 <style>
-.and {
-  css: too !important;
-}
-</style>
\ No newline at end of file
+.and { css: too !important }
+</style>
```

# Output

```vue
<template>
  <p>Templates are formatted as well...
    </p>
</template>

<script>
let Prettier        = format => { your.js('though') }
</script>

<style>
.and { css: too !important }
